  "bio": {
    "eyebrow": "About Dr Susanto",
    "heading_lead": "Meet",
    "heading_warm": "Dr Susanto.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dr Clarissa Susanto is a Respiratory and Sleep Medicine Physician (ABN: 26 748 680 976) (MED0001191927) consulting at the Earlwood & Bangor centres.",
      "Dr Clarissa Susanto is a graduate of the University of New South Wales and completed her specialist training at Prince of Wales Hospital and Concord Hospital. She is a Staff Specialist in the Department of Respiratory and Sleep Medicine at Sutherland Hospital and is also accredited at Hurstville Private Hospital.",
      "She has broad experience in the management of general and complex respiratory and sleep conditions, including airways disease, lung cancer, pulmonary infections, interstitial lung diseases, respiratory failure, sleep-related breathing disorders, hypersomnolence disorders, parasomnias and insomnias. She is accredited in performing bronchoscopy procedures including Endobronchial Ultrasound (EBUS).",
      "Dr Susanto believes in the importance of open communication and education to ensure that the patient fully understands their condition and their treatment plan. Patient involvement in the management plan is pivotal to her delivery of care.",
      "Dr Susanto is fluent in Bahasa Indonesia in addition to English."
    ]
  },
